<!--
  The launcher icon's palette. These are not new colours: each one is a value
  already in `spec/ui/v1/tokens.json` (light side), copied here because an
  adaptive icon is resolved by the launcher before the app draws anything and
  therefore cannot go through `PdshTheme` / the generated UiTokenData.

    pdsh_icon_background  <- colors.primary.light  #111114
    pdsh_icon_mark        <- colors.onAccent.light #FFFFFF
    pdsh_icon_cursor      <- colors.accent.light   #3964FE

  A token change here would be a token change in the icon; keep the two files in
  step, and prefer adding a token over inventing a colour.
-->
<resources>
    <color name="pdsh_icon_background">#111114</color>
    <color name="pdsh_icon_mark">#FFFFFF</color>
    <color name="pdsh_icon_cursor">#3964FE</color>
</resources>
